nimDividedCohomology -- Computes the dimension or character of sheaf cohomology of twists of divided powers of the cotangent sheaf on projective space, in characteristic 2
***************************************************************************************************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        C = nimDividedCohomology(i,d,e,n)
        C = nimDividedCohomology(i,d,e,R)
  * Inputs:
      * i, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, cohomological degree
      * d, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, divided power of the cotangent
        sheaf
      * e, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, twist of the sheaf
      * n, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, dimension of projective space +
        1
      * R, a *note polynomial ring: (Macaulay2Doc)PolynomialRing,, ambient
        polynomial ring of the character, i.e. ZZ[x_1..x_n] where n-1 is the
        dimension of projective space
