      * *note FindCharacter: FindCharacter, => ..., default value false, An
        option to compute the character instead of the dimension
  * Outputs:
      * C, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, dimension of the cohomology
        group H^i(P^{n-1}, D^d Omega (d+e)), with the option to instead have
        the character

Description
===========

This function computes in characteristic 2 the sheaf cohomology of twists of
divided powers of the cotangent sheaf on projective space
$H^i(\mathbb{P}^{n-1}, D^d \mathcal{R}(d))$, where $D^d \mathcal{R}$ is the
d-th divided power of the universal rank (n-1) subsheaf $\mathcal{R}$.

+----------------------------------+
|i1 : i =1; d = 5; e = 4; n = 3;   |
+----------------------------------+
|i5 : nimDividedCohomology(i,d,e,n)|
|                                  |
|o5 = 8                            |
