This function can also output the character instead of just the dimension,
setting the option FindCharacter to be true.

+-------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : i = 1; d = 5; e = 4; n = 3;                                   |
+-------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i10 : nimDividedCohomology(i,d,e,n, FindCharacter => true)         |
