File: IncidenceCorrespondenceCohomology.info, Node: FindCharacter, Prev: incidenceCohomology, Up: Top

FindCharacter -- An option to compute the character instead of the dimension
****************************************************************************

Description
===========

The default value is false.  When defined to be true, the function will output
the character instead of the dimension for the cohomology.

See also
========

  * *note recursiveDividedCohomology: recursiveDividedCohomology, -- Computes
    dimension or character of sheaf cohomology of twists of divided powers of
    the cotangent sheaf on projective space
  * *note nimDividedCohomology: nimDividedCohomology, -- Computes the dimension
    or character of sheaf cohomology of twists of divided powers of the
    cotangent sheaf on projective space, in characteristic 2
  * *note incidenceCohomology: incidenceCohomology, -- Computes dimension or
    character of sheaf cohomology of line bundles on the incidence
    correspondence

